What emerges
- 31.6% of the movies have no keywords, almost all of them movies with few votes: queries on keywords
  in practice concern the best known movies.

- Keywords per movie: average 3.4, median 2, maximum 149 (Werckmeister Harmonies).

	keywords   movies
	0          31.6%
	1          14.2%
	2-5        33.0%
	6-10       13.4%
	11-20       6.9%
	21+         1.0%

- 43.6% of the keywords (8,691 out of 19,956) are used by a single movie.
- Most used keywords: woman director (3,039 movies, 6.7%), independent film (1,914, 4.2%),
  murder (1,285, 2.8%), based on novel (822, 1.8%), musical (726, 1.6%).
